subject: fix(usage): support /api/balance for ollama cloud quota tracking (#5026)

Ollama Cloud has migrated active quota limits from /api/usage to /api/balance.
The /api/usage endpoint now only reports activity history metrics.

- Fall back to /api/balance when /api/usage limits are missing
- Support session (5h) and weekly (7d) remaining percentages and reset timestamps
- Support allowance_usd and purchased credits
- Pass through balance metadata (isCreditBalance, currency, unit, unlimited) to QuotaTable
- Add comprehensive vitest coverage for /api/balance parsing


